* SPICE Netlist
* Components: BJTs, Resistor, Current Sources

* Transistors (Assuming NPN BJTs)
QR 6 2 4 NPN ; QR:
Q1 2 2 0 NPN ; Q1:
Q2 3 2 0 NPN ; Q2:
Q3 5 2 0 NPN ; Q3:

* Resistor
R1 V+ 2 R1_VALUE ; R1 connected from V+ to node 2

* Current Sources
IREF V+ 6 IREF_VALUE ; I_REF connected from V+ to node 6
I1 2 0 I1_VALUE ; I1 connected from node 2 to ground
I2 3 4 I2_VALUE ; I2 connected from node 3 to node 4
I3 5 4 I3_VALUE ; I3 connected from node 5 to node 4
IO 3 2 IO_VALUE ; IO connected from node 3 to node 2

* Voltage Source for V+
V+ V+ 0 DC ; Defines the positive supply voltage

* Models for NPN transistors
.model NPN NPN